{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50158","headline":"昭君怨（其三。斯五五五） · 东方虬","name":"昭君怨（其三。斯五五五）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万里胡风急，三秋[□]汉初。\n唯望南去雁，不肯爲传书。\n（按这诗的其一、其二、其四三首已载《全唐诗》，故仅补「其三」一首。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"东方虬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50158.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50158","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}